        "explanation": "<div class=\"eng-formula-box formula\">\n          <strong class=\"eng-formula-title\">1. Hệ thống Động từ Tường thuật & Thức Giả định (Days 51–52)</strong>\n          <ul>\n            <li><b>Reporting Verbs:</b> <code>deny / suggest / admit + V-ing</code> | <code>insist on / warn against / apologize for + V-ing</code> | <code>accuse sb of / congratulate sb on + V-ing</code> | <code>urge / advise / persuade + O + to-V</code>.</li>\n            <li><b>Mandative Subjunctive:</b> Sau <code>demand, recommend, propose, insist, stipulate</code> hoặc <code>It is essential / vital / imperative / crucial / mandatory + that</code> -> <code>S + (should) + V_bare</code> (Phủ định: <code>not + V_bare</code>; Bị động: <code>be + V3/ed</code>).</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"eng-formula-box formula\">\n          <strong class=\"eng-formula-title\">2. Giả định Lùi thì & Câu Chẻ Nhấn mạnh (Days 53–54)</strong>\n          <ul>\n            <li><b>Unreal Past vs. Had better:</b> <code>It's (high/about) time + S + V2/ed</code> | <code>S1 + would rather + S2 + V2/ed</code> (hiện tại) hoặc <code>had + V3/ed</code> (quá khứ) | <code>S + had better (not) + V_bare</code>.</li>\n            <li><b>Cleft Sentences:</b> <code>It is/was + [X] + that/who + ...</code> | <code>What + S + V + is/was + [X]</code> | <code>What + S + do/did + is/was + (to) V_bare</code>.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>",
